      ],
      "source": "https://northberrienhistory.blogspot.com/p/blog-page_1653.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1834, settler Jehiel Enos built a saw mill and a grist mill that helped plat the community the next year.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://northberrienhistory.blogspot.com/p/blog-page_1653.html",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Lake Michigan’s moderating influence creates ideal fruit‑growing conditions, making the area one of the nation’s most productive agricultural zones.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
